== Changelog ==

= 1.3.0 =
* "Show who is calling": when someone signed in to your website calls, Listen shows you their name and email with the call. Off until you turn it on.

= 1.2.0 =
* Choose the pages that show the call button from a list of your website's pages, with a search, "Select all" and "Clear", instead of typing their IDs.
* The list also has your latest posts, and your products if you sell some.
* The settings page shows at a glance whether the button is on and where it shows, with links to your website and to the button's look in Listen.
* The pages you chose before stay chosen.

= 1.1.0 =
* Show the call button on every page, or only on the pages you choose.
* The button's script loads the way WordPress recommends: asynchronously, at the end of the page.
* Every setting is checked strictly, and only administrators can change the settings.
* Arabic comes with the plugin as WordPress translation files.
* WordPress never replaces this plugin with another plugin of the same name.
* Needs WordPress 6.5 or newer and PHP 8.1 or newer.

= 1.0.0 =
* The call button on every page, with your agent already set.

